    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 155,
        "text": "We asked twenty residents to answer our questionnaire about the outdoor meeting area. Each participant chose one improvement, and all twenty replied.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2a6fee5929c1636f6909d04296ee267e3cdd7808e1fdb3d1e6bc79075467c742",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 162,
        "sourceEnd": 188,
        "text": "What does the record show?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "dabcd49654081d461c4803d5d36d076de1478b99c3c64d801caa31c556ba9967",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 195,
        "sourceEnd": 339,
        "text": "Eight chose more seats, six chose shade, and six chose drinking water. The sample is small, so we should not say it represents everyone in town.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b4902713afa44f4c63f00d6452400b2879a9eed3d68aa17a4d1aa0194ebd6749",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 346,
        "sourceEnd": 379,
        "text": "What is the percentage for seats?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1ebd1cd0ebad04e3b5f42f7252216db75b197d9706ea04545d7f380621990ac8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 386,
        "sourceEnd": 520,
        "text": "Eight out of twenty is forty percent. The fraction is 8/20, or two fifths. The ratio of seat choices to shade choices is eight to six.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "39e77c6f566efd1ca82ccdcfb72cc128b4f7e36cc554df56f86896a903296161",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 527,
        "sourceEnd": 658,
        "text": "That means seats are the largest single category, but eight is less than half of twenty. We should not call those eight a majority.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5d2c0f7d28006e312471b0354c18fec03205489dadc8a251dc10e37bc984b5b7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 665,
        "sourceEnd": 811,
        "text": "Exactly. A minority chose seats, even though that option received more votes than either other option. We can put the three counts on a bar chart.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6887113adb5d9474d3f8ced0d19c14bf578e1859f960bc47ca7f6b271968fbaa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 818,
        "sourceEnd": 862,
        "text": "How does this compare with the earlier poll?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9bb503a04cdb6eeabbb48abcd85d375006d390fdb9aef2393289aaa3de3f6d84",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 869,
        "sourceEnd": 1065,
        "text": "The earlier poll had another set of twenty people. Four chose seats, eight chose shade, and eight chose water. Seat choices increase from four to eight, while the other two counts show a decrease.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a14efc190a359872d8e25e7395f9e02f638272daa1ef83864202c766d9e79c34",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 1072,
        "sourceEnd": 1107,
        "text": "Can we call that a long-term trend?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9bdccd7d269f8963d65fff0f6750662c4db43cfbb3e1f385d0e0f9da167a1472",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 1114,
        "sourceEnd": 1272,
        "text": "No. There are only two rounds, and the people may be different. We can say that one count may rise or remain stable in a future round, but we cannot know yet.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0b6401654f7c22bd87d5ead5fe82b4257ecf88fb89a59ef5c79cdd22542ec4d1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 1279,
        "sourceEnd": 1341,
        "text": "What about the average and median in the example on the board?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "66a638edb91284b188509b394cae29c3b39082805e545c3463524ae0667720a0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 1348,
        "sourceEnd": 1581,
        "text": "Those are practice waiting times, not survey answers. The times are three, five and ten minutes. The mean is six because their sum is eighteen, and eighteen divided by three is six; the median is five because it is the middle number.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6568134ac9f4ea1a1ff72fcb99b491b25c8ee73b073e46f21277b46b0fe3eeb8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 1588,
        "sourceEnd": 1710,
        "text": "I will write that distinction in our report. We could use the data to estimate what to test next, then ask more residents.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "57172c64827a3f39e41e932b6f9a6219239934450efb85923eaaf3398c79a5b6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 1717,
        "sourceEnd": 1897,
        "text": "Good. All twenty invited people replied, so the participation rate was one hundred percent, but it is still only a small group. Let's survey a wider group before making a decision.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "509d0944480adfdabf4bb9118b7b02a77f93bb8f7c92f3e6655445c4dd0c9da5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
